sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as migrateHtmlTemplates.cjs
    participant DB as DocumentTemplate
    participant C as HtmlToDocSchemaConverter
    participant V as assertValidDocSchema

    Note over S: 决策1 运行迁移脚本
    S->>DB: find({engine:'html'})
    DB-->>S: 命中 N 条
    S->>S: 写 backups/html-templates-<ts>.json (原始留痕)
    loop 每条 doc
        S->>C: convertHtmlToDocSchema(doc.content)
        C-->>S: {docSchema, variables, report}
        S->>V: assertValidDocSchema(docSchema)
        alt 合法
            S->>DB: updateOne({_id},{$set:{engine:'schema',docSchema,variables}})
        else 非法
            S->>S: 记入 report.failed
        end
    end
    S->>S: 写 migration-reports + 控制台摘要
    S->>DB: disconnect()

    Note over S,DB: 重跑 -> engine 已 'schema' -> find 为空 -> no-op

    participant TF as TemplateFill(前端)
    participant TS as templateService
    participant R as POST /:id/resolve
    participant TR as TemplateResolver
    participant P as Personnel/Company
    participant M as Meeting

    Note over TF,M: 决策2 选董事/会议 -> /resolve
    TF->>TS: resolve(id, {companyId, directorIds, meetingId})
    TS->>R: POST /api/templates/:id/resolve
    R->>TR: resolveValues(template, {companyId, directorIds, meetingId})
    TR->>P: Personnel.find / Company.links 聚合
    TR->>M: Meeting.findById(meetingId)
    TR-->>R: {values, autoFilled}
    R-->>TF: {values, autoFilled}
    TF->>TF: 合并进表单 (绿色高亮)

    Note over TF: 决策3 点击「复制 HTML」
    TF->>TF: serializePreviewToHtml(previewRef.current)
    TF->>TF: copyHtmlToClipboard(html)
    TF-->>TF: toast「已复制 HTML 到剪贴板」
